        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**SnapBackup 备份恢复**\n\n轻量、现代 UI 的越狱备份工具，专为解决重装、重越狱、迁移插件与配置的痛点而设计。支持 rootless 与 RootHide 隐根环境，一键把已装插件现场重打包成 .deb，同时备份软件源列表和插件偏好配置。",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "恢复难易度说明"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**恢复配置：★☆☆ 简单**\nApp 内一键恢复 plist 到 `/var/mobile/Library/Preferences/`，本地执行，**无需 root 权限**。\n\n**恢复插件：★★★ 较难**\n需要 root 权限。通过「Filza 显示」跳转 Filza，手动安装 debs/ 下的 deb（或用 dpkg -i），装完注销/重启生效。",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "操作流程"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "① 备份",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "主页 →「一键备份」→ 选模式（全部插件 / 勾选的插件+配置 / 仅配置）→ 等待完成。备份保存在 `/var/mobile/Documents/SnapBackup/`。",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "② 恢复配置",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "主页 →「恢复配置」→ 选备份包 → 自动把 plist 恢复到原位置（无需 root）。",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "③ 恢复插件（需 root）",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "备份包卡片 →「Filza 显示」→ 进入 `debs/` 文件夹 → 逐个点 deb 安装（或 dpkg -i）→ 注销/重启 SpringBoard 生效。",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
